{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_tiger_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_tiger_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"干员间切磋指南","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_tiger_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"53f193ec66a425c7d4fc64abe37bf95858bbe4622b92ae5000b04ce4cc3bee57","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"为了王，也为了在船上和在家乡的伙伴，因陀罗努力学习着什么时候该挥拳，什么时候该松手。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"个人剧情 因陀罗"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"narration","text":"8:27 A. M. 天气/晴\n罗德岛本舰，训练场"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"准备好了吗？我来啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"没用！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"动手之前谁会打招呼？这太蠢了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"尝尝这一拳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"你这拳头跟枕头没两样，软绵绵的，冻了两天的黑面包都比这个硬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......明明移动速度没有我快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么就是打不到？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"没用，完全没用！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"谁教你这么打架的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸教我的......格斗技巧......爸爸是很厉害的警察！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？张口闭口爸爸，你还是小孩子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"不要分心哦，我会找到机会的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，这一拳像点样子了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"再来，再来再来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"（躲、躲不开......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"这攻击......角度好刁钻！这是什么拳法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？拳法？老子打架靠的就不是什么拳法！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"有功夫念叨，倒是拿出点真本事啊！老子还想多流点汗！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"越来越快了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"太慢，还是太慢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊，我的眼睛！差一点！好险！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......哈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"（根本没有还手的机会......肚子上又挨了一下......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"没劲！太没劲了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，我说你，你是看不起老子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"我打你，我是认真的。你，看上去把式不错，出手却老是磨磨唧唧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"小子，你听好了，刚刚那一拳头，你要冲着老子的鼻子来，鼻子，在这里！看到没？砰一下，血就飙出来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"我......啊哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸说过......我的拳头，应该只让敌人流血......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊好烦啊！嗡嗡嗡的都是废话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"一点都不痛快！打架，就只是打架而已，为什么要想那么多？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"你这小子，倒是挺抗揍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"一般人挨了我好几下，早就哭着喊着求饶了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我不会求饶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"你很厉害，但你也不能......小瞧我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"哟哟，这话不错，有点意思了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"看在你没逃走的份上，我就痛痛快快地让你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"住手！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"......挡下了我的拳头？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么东西？鞭子？你，不错嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"杜宾老师......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"杰克，你下去，让Lancet-2临时处理下身上的伤，然后去医务室报到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"可是训练......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"上午的训练课程允许你缺席。特殊情况，下不为例。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，你记住，哪怕是在罗德岛，训练场就是战场，你眼前只有对手，没有朋友。在敌人面前，你的温柔全都是弱点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"下次再被揍成这样，我就要考虑给你加课了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"记住了，老师！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......因陀罗干员，谢谢你今天陪我练习！下次我一定会表现更好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，没劲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"你站住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，你也想跟我打架吗？你的话，看起来很不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会陪你过家家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"过家家？你说打架是过家家？喂，没搞错吧，你知道我是怎么过来的嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......因陀罗干员，你现在的行为在我看来非常幼稚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经不是学生，不需要我来安排课程。但我还是想给你一些建议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，第一条——在你准备好之前，不要再踏入训练场一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？凭什么？那个小兔子跟我说，想打架的话，都可以来这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想把时间浪费在指出你这句话有多少错误上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，训练场不是你发泄私人情绪的地方。干员之间的切磋也并不以给对方造成永久性损伤为目标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"等你想清楚了，你可以再过来。新人们很需要你的战斗经验来提供实战指导。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"但是现在，请你离开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。一帮子只会嘴上吧啦吧啦的家伙，一个比一个没意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"每天憋在这里，没有架打，实在难受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"吃的都是些什么玩意儿，有肉有土豆就成了，整那么多花样和调料干什么？嚼着腻味，嘴巴都淡得长毛了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"还有这房间，冷冰冰的铁板子，还这么窄，这是人待的地方吗？这是监牢吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"（砰——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"加油，你再花点力气，就能给这墙开个洞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"我当是哪个无聊的家伙，原来是最无聊的那个。摩根，你有本事就别站在外面，你进来给老子打一拳，让老子爽一下啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"我不要进来，打我你是打不着，可谁知道你下回憋不住砸墙的时候拳头长不长眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"再说了，我不像你，我很忙的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，你那些事，我还真懒得搞清楚，反正就是跑来跑去的总不见人影，和过去一个样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀呀，人家再忙也不会忘了你，我的小汉娜~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"听说你在训练场大闹了一通，然后被赶出来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"......你就是来笑话我的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧，你这么说，我可要伤心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"说我关心你你不信，那就当成我替维娜来看看，你有没有给她惹麻烦吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"主子知道了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"别紧张嘛，我没去告状啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"但是啊，我们现在在别人船上，你做的事情，哪一件不会落到她耳朵里？你以为她是谁啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，这次是老子错了还不行吗！我自己去找主子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，别着急嘛。也来了好一阵了，罗德岛的人怎么样，你我都很清楚吧？维娜处境不错，我们都用不着过得太紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说得对，我承认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的人还不错。不像过去遇到的那样......要么太坏，要么太弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"但不代表我非要喜欢这种生活。哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"嘴上说着不喜欢，实际上还是不习惯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"我......嘁，怎么可能习惯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"突然之间，不用每天躲来躲去，不会好几天找不到地方睡觉，也用不着睡着了还要担心有敌人靠近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"想想还真有点怀念呢，那时候你哪怕正睡着，听到些响动就要睁一下眼，还会对着空气挥好几下拳头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"......是谁非要偷偷靠过来的？没给你揍出黑眼圈，算老子手下留情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"不光能好好睡觉了，这地方还总有热乎的东西可以吃，也用不上害怕吃着吃着坐在对面的人就要掏家伙来偷袭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"离开伦蒂尼姆这么久，一路上哪里有过这种日子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"一、二、三......我已经整整十四天没有见过血，摩根，你说说看，你让我怎么习惯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"你瞧瞧，你说的这些，都说明维娜决定带着我们一起来罗德岛是对的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"我们需要的罗德岛都能给。不光是一张床，一点吃的。你呀，你总是对我说的这些没兴趣，但你心里都是明白的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我不需要知道敌人是谁，我只需要知道他们是敌人。我也能看清楚谁是真正的朋友，谁能真的帮到维娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"我还没忘，我跟着她到这里是为了什么。我想看她拔剑。为了那一天，我因陀罗什么都能做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......摩根，我最近好几次梦见留下的那帮臭小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂了，你其实是在担心那些家伙吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"谁担心她们！老子是那种瞎想的人嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"真心话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"关键就是，老子什么都不知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道她们过得怎么样，有没有受伤，有没有生病，有没有......别人来找她们麻烦，尤其是那些家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"我躺在这又软又干净的床上，我就忍不住想，她们呢，她们现在怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"你比任何人都了解她们。这么多年了，我们熟悉彼此，如同熟悉自己的手足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"你难道忘了，从小生活在伦蒂尼姆的我们，比谁都清楚如何在一次次争斗中活下来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"我是相信她们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"——就跟她们一直信我一样。摩根，你也没忘吧？她们每一个，还是小孩子的时候就跟在我们屁股后面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，当然记得。对了，那时候你也在我屁股后面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，能不能别打岔？就算我在你后面，也是你跑太快，老子是为了随时踢你屁股。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎样，那时候......我们发过誓。不说能不能有好日子，但至少不管什么日子，每个人都有份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"可现在......现在......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"别唉声叹气的了。跟着维娜走这么远，难道你后悔了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"因陀罗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才我说的作战计划，你都听清楚了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"前半部分很明白，就是最后......维娜，你没说我完事之后应该去哪里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"这一部分，我想让你自己来选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以来这个位置，与我会合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"你也可以去那个位置。到时候她们几个会等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"然后你需要带着她们迅速移动，之后该干什么干什么，不要再回到这里来，也不要再找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜......你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我必须离开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"是外面那些家伙？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"乌云越来越近，你肯定也有所察觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，那群跟鼻涕一样甩不脱的混球！来一个我打跑一个，来一群我打跑一群！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"这已经不像打一架抢地盘那么简单。受伤的人正在变多。要不了多久，局势就会超出我们目前的力量能掌控的范畴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不能坐以待毙，在这之前......我必须把主动权握在手里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"行，摩根那家伙也这么说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——我跟她不一样。我不想那么多有的没的。我只需要你告诉我，到这一天了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，这一天到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"我留在这里，你们每个人都有危险。你们都不想当懦夫，我也一样。可是，我更厌恶无谓的牺牲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，抗争永远不会停止，无论是在伦蒂尼姆，还是在外面。我们总有事情做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"那我会跟着你！你在哪里，我就在哪里，只要你需要我的拳头一天，我就跟着你一天！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"因陀罗，你是我最信任的朋友。我享受和你并肩的每一场战斗。但今天，请你明白，我绝对不是在命令你跟我走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我不确定自己什么时候才能回到这里。假如你决定跟着我，你也一样。从此往后，我们每天都可能在不同的地方流浪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"之后会面临的一切，不用我说，你也能够想象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......你是我问的第一个人。毕竟在我加入格拉斯哥帮之前，你是她们的头领。我想你或许会更愿意为了她们而留下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过了，这根本不是什么需要想的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"在我认你当主子的那一天，我就已经决定好了之后的每一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去的地方，就是我要去的地方。我的双手，会为你扫除你的敌人，也会为你拥抱你的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，要是你希望我留下来，我根本不会说一句话，我一定会为你留下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"可如果你问我——你就不需要问我第二次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"我的答案只有一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信你，维娜，你是我的王！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"后悔......不可能。永远都不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"跟着主子，就是我这辈子做的最正确的决定！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀呀，你这突然嗓门这么大，我看走廊另一头的维娜都要给你吵醒咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你别乱说话，昨天晚上她又想事情想到那么晚，现在肯定睡得正香。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"行了行了，看你这么有精神，我也不用陪你聊天了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"你接着用拳头给墙开洞去吧。等有了洞，想跑就跑不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"char_154_morgan","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"老子......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"混球摩根，老子的字典里就没有逃跑两个字！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛。我的王选择了罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"那我也一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"......憋在房间里的话，还是看哪哪都不顺眼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"好烦，好烦啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，谁啊？肯定不是摩根，那笨蛋学不会敲门。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是我，因陀罗干员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"被揍成那样了居然还能站起来，你小子不错嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是说这些伤吗？哈哈，没关系的啦，医生姐姐们都帮我处理过了。过去爸爸带我训练，偶尔我也会把自己搞得鼻青脸肿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"那你不是来报仇的咯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，报仇？没有的事啊，这些伤是因陀罗干员留下的，可是你不是在帮我训练吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"你这小子，有点意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，因陀罗干员是在夸奖我吗？那我可不可以请你下次再陪我训练？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"还想挨揍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才在医务室，我就在想，因陀罗干员的拳法——呃，不说拳法啦，打架，说打架吧！因陀罗干员打架真的好厉害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"我感受到了很多以前没学过的东西，我想向你好好学习！拜托啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要向我学习？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你确定吗？刚刚才被揍成那样，你还敢找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"被揍也是我自己实力不够，怪不了因陀罗干员啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，这里的人，果然和外面的不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"那个拿鞭子的佩洛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，那是杜宾老师！她是我们的教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"叫啥都无所谓！......啧，你那是什么表情，行了，我知道了，杜宾是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"那个杜宾，她说我要是准备好的话，还能回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就去试试看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克","speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，因陀罗干员答应我了？太棒啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，别高兴得太早，老子动起手来不会客气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......哼，切磋是吧，不就是控制分寸嘛，简单得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"char_155_tiger","isRemote":false,"text":"指点你这样的小家伙而已，才难不倒老子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_112_seige","aliases":["推进之王"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜宾"]},{"speakerId":"char_154_morgan","aliases":["摩根"]},{"speakerId":"char_155_tiger","aliases":["因陀罗"]},{"speakerId":"char_347_jaksel","aliases":["杰克"]}]}
